= Philip Snowden

Snowden is a christian socalist. A former liberal MP, he's a strict adeherent of economic orthadoxy and believes in the importance of a balanced budget.

- @against_right_and_left
- @toleration
- @chancellor_of_the_exchequer_
- @economic_democracy_
- @root: Return to main

@against_right_and_left
title: Against Right and Left
subtitle: As a Centrist, Snowden seeks to steer a course between the party's factions.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 5; advisor_action_time = time; center_strength += 10; left_strength -= 5; labor_strength -= 5; neorevisionist_strength -= 5; center_dissent -= 10

We have reduced the strength of the dissident factions in the party.

@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: Snowden supports cooperation with the liberals.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not labour_toleration: Labour is not in toleration. ?]
view-if: liberals_in_government = 1
choose-if: labour_in_government = 0 and labour_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5

We have reduced dissent among the anti-toleration factions.

@chancellor_of_the_exchequer_
title: Fiscal Policy
subtitle: Chancellor, Snowden can enact tax policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if labour_in_government = 0 : Labour isn't in government: ?] [? if chancellor_of_the_exchequer_party != "Labour" : Labour doesn't control the Treasury. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and labour_in_government == 1 and chancellor_of_the_exchequer_party == "Labour"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; fiscal_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: fiscal_policy

@economic_democracy_
title: Radical Agenda
subtitle: Enact Labour's major Policy Platform.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if labour_in_government = 0 : Labour not in government: ?] [? if labor_minister_party != "Labour" or (chancellor_of_the_exchequer_party != "Labour" and economic_minister_party != "Labour") : We do not have the necessary government ministers. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and labour_in_government == 1 and (economic_minister_party == "Labour" or chancellor_of_the_exchequer_party == "Labour") and (labor_minister_party == "Labour")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_democracy_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: radical_agenda
